  "description": "A fluent C# API for generating C# source code — a readable facade over Roslyn's SyntaxFactory. Targets netstandard2.0 so it works inside incremental source generators, where Roslyn's own SyntaxGenerator (in Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Workspaces) cannot be referenced.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "FluentRoslyn",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-05T22:27:21.913Z",
